ript itself, no other text or markdown.",
  "raw_response": "def solve(grid):\n    \"\"\"\n    Transform a square input grid into a larger grid according to the discovered rule.\n\n    The input grid is of size N x N (N even). Each non\u2011zero cell at position (r, c)\n    is expanded into a 4x4 block of the same value placed at\n\n        output rows  [(r//2)*4 , (r//2)*4 + 3]\n        output cols  [(c//2)*4 , (c//2)*4 + 3]\n\n    All other cells remain 0. The output size is (N//2)*4 (i.e. 20 for N=10).\n    \"\"\"\n    if not grid:\n        return []\n\n    rows = len(grid)\n    cols = len(grid[0])\n\n    out_rows = (rows // 2) * 4\n    out_cols = (cols // 2) * 4\n\n    # initialise output with zeros\n    out = [[0] * out_cols for _ in range(out_rows)]\n\n    for r in range(rows):\n        for c in range(cols):\n            val = grid[r][c]\n            if val == 0:\n                continue\n            block_r = (r // 2) * 4\n            block_c = (c // 2) * 4\n            for i in range(4):\n                for j in range(4):\n                    out[block_r + i][block_c + j] = val\n\n    return out",
